# OS
# Alternate Data Streams that Windows attaches to downloaded files. They carry
# nothing but `[ZoneTransfer] ZoneId=3`, and the `:` in their name makes the
# whole repository impossible to check out on Windows — `git clone` aborts with
# "invalid path". Seven of them had been committed alongside the screenshots.
*:Zone.Identifier
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

